<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-C.bank dollar/rouble rates 5795/5811.</title>
<headline>TABLE-C.bank dollar/rouble rates 5795/5811.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5795/5811 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Thursday will be 5803.</p>
<p>On Tuesday the bid/offer rates were 5794/5810, with the official dollar rate 5802 from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
